From 49e42aa9b525d10a9fef0725b0e773be9d418314 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Solomon Kinard <solomonkinard@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:42:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 15/32] Extensions: WAR: Share generated path URL helpers

The favicon and generated background page URL checks were duplicated
in extension_protocols.cc and web_accessible_resources_info.cc. Both
copies must agree for the generated path restrictions to be
consistent, so move them to extensions/common/extension_urls.h as
IsGeneratedFaviconURL() and IsGeneratedBackgroundPageURL().

IsGeneratedFaviconURL() no longer allocates a string per call.

No behavior change. Add unit tests for both helpers in
extension_urls_unittest.cc.

Bug: 506142100
Change-Id: Ib39ca2e28be1929eb795028f8be0436e6f693524
